    "Statement Required by Article 35 (2) of the Town and Country Planning (Development Management Procedure) (England) Order 2015: In accordance with paragraph 38 of the National Planning Policy Framework, improvements required to make the proposal acceptable were shared with the agent via email on 11/07/2025. The revisions involved a depth reduction of the proposed outbuilding. The applicant decided to progress with the application as originally proposed.",
